/*
 Cards
 */

"pageOfPentacles_description" = "The card today is an auspicious day for you. It will allow you to realize your most intimate dreams. Agree on promising contracts, provide help and support to those around you, both in a moral and material sense. Also, the card can warn of the appearance in your life of a man who is quite self-contained and prudent. It can bring you any chance for new beginnings.";
"pageOfSwords_description" = "Today you can hear criticism against you, and your proposals, most likely, can be rejected. You just need to prepare yourself for this initially, so that later you don’t get upset and don’t get up in a counterattack. By the way, criticism can be very useful for you, as it carries something of value. If you listen to the spoken words, then much will become clear in your life. There will definitely come a moment in your life when you can reveal your potential, because you have everything for this: sociability, ingenuity, quick wit, contact. Also today you can get some important information for yourself, which can unsettle you a little.";
"pageOfWands_description" = "The Page of Wands portends a bright and unusual event. You need to be careful and not miss the sign of an upcoming pleasant surprise. This can be a promotion, and a pleasant meeting, and a dizzying romance that begins. But this does not mean at all that the event will be fateful. Perhaps this will turn out to be just a very interesting and enjoyable episode for you, which will turn into a plot for stories to your grandchildren.";
"pageOfCups_description" = "Fate is on your side today. New opportunities and emotional nourishment will open up before you. Today is the day when you can accept the gifts of fate, while giving nothing in return. This can even manifest itself in ordinary trifles (compliments, declarations of love, an honorable compromise in difficult circumstances). Your undertakings will bear fruit, and the things you have done before will end in success. By the way, you can think about career growth, there are prospects for you.";
"knightOfPentacles_description" = "Today you have a great chance - to make an important and responsible decision. Even a problem that seemed difficult and impossible to you will be resolved today in the best possible way. But, and if there are no problems and you don’t need to solve problems, then it’s time to relax, give yourself time for something that you later remember with pleasure. In any case, the day may seem long and slow to you.";
"knightOfSwords_description" = "The Knight of Swords can warn you of conflict, which is why today you need to think clearly and soberly react to what is happening, and even to some extent in cold blood. Discuss, preferably without emotion. Thanks to this, even in a difficult situation, you can hope to win. But if the dispute remains without winners, this will also benefit you, not harm you.";
"knightOfWands_description" = "The Knight of Wands may bring you some kind of quarrel or omission today. Do not start to realize your affairs and plans, keep calm. Or today you can catch fire with some idea and the desire to rush to implement it. Do not have any special illusions, you will need to weigh and analyze it, otherwise it may remain a flash.";
"knightOfCups_description" = "Today your day will be very bright and filled with events. Your mood today will be uplifted, you will feel great, your energy will be in full swing. Use today for its intended purpose, solve cases for which you have not had enough time and energy for a long time.";
"kingOfPentacles_description" = "Today you will have a good opportunity to take stock. Don't miss out on the opportunity to start a new business. Remember the need to achieve everything with your personal work. Everything will work out with your due concentration and concentration. Also, the card can tell you about the manifestation of a man who loves you very much. He may be much older than you in age, and may be your father.";
"kingOfSwords_description" = "Fate may give you an exam today and you need to mentally prepare for this. You will need to show your knowledge, ingenuity and the ability to use your own experience. You must prepare well for this test, and for this you must have convincing projects, facts, arguments, it would not be superfluous for you to use your charm and wit.";
"kingOfWands_description" = "The King of Wands brings you a good omen today. Your business will be successful. It is possible that a person will help you in one of the areas of your life. You can prepare for a windfall profit, a job offer, or just being the center of attention today. The card can also talk about a meeting with a wealthy fan or signs of attention from management.";
"kingOfCups_description" = "The card recommends that you hold back your feelings a little today. Make decisions, first of all, coordinating them with your mind, and not with your heart. However, do not skimp on emotions with your loved one or with someone who craves your care and attention. Share what worries you, what hurts your soul. In response, you will receive only pleasant words of support, wise and effective advice. On this day, you may meet a handsome man who will play an important role in your near future.";
"queenOfPentacles_description" = "You shouldn't let other people manipulate you. Now it's up to you, do your job consistently and keep long-term projects in mind. Today it is possible for you to meet a woman who has strong maternal feelings and kindness. It is this woman who can play an important role in your destiny. You should listen to what she has to say.";
"queenOfSwords_description" = "Today, fate will tell you to take the right step. If quite recently you were still dependent on someone, now the day has come when everything will change significantly for you for the better. Now you don't have to be shy about anything, behave freely and naturally under any circumstances.";
"queenOfWands_description" = "Today is the day for your decisive action, you will feel confident and strong energy. Any, even the most difficult work will be on your shoulder. You are ready to take decisive steps, you show courageous qualities and an optimistic attitude to business. Today, people around you will notice this, they will follow you, because in your life you so lack human support, optimism and wise advice.";
"queenOfCups_description" = "Today will bring you a special sensitivity and sensuality in the emotional mood of the people around you. There is a possibility that you may suffer because of someone else's behavior. Be careful, fate sends signs everywhere. Stay true to yourself, your principles, your feelings. However, do not take what you passionately desire to possess at face value, this does not happen in reality.";

/*
 Map
 */
"pageOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Page of Pentacles often speaks of important news regarding studies, work, or income. The card is quite favorable in everyday practical life issues. She shows a rational and pragmatic approach to business and speaks of the importance of not missing the moment and not postponing your affairs and plans. The Page of Pentacles can also speak of a wonderful chance to improve your financial situation, get a good job and a stable income. Can talk about advisory, financial, practical support, as well as the opportunity to succeed on their own, mastering some new occupation and finding application for their abilities. It can show excellent opportunities and prospects in acquiring knowledge, success in learning - fate comes forward, providing interesting opportunities. The card speaks of a good chance to start a new project and the availability of resources for a conceived business, even if these resources are just the ability and opportunity to learn. This card speaks of diligence, diligent work, a serious attitude to your ideas and deeds. Its most common meanings are admission to an educational institution or successful study. This is a card of good prospects in practice, it represents an important and valuable impulse that will bear fruit for a long time to come. The card recommends opening up to a person and trying to get the most out of the opportunity. Can also talk about tempting and good offers. The energy of this card is the power of concentration on some business, concentrated efforts and diligence, as well as logical and natural progress. She speaks of complete immersion in her work, focus on the goal. Even if the surrounding cards speak of failure, the presence of this card says that you can find a happy chance and opportunity in what is happening. The card can also talk about a good deal, life experience or an unexpected, but very favorable way out of the situation. It is also a map of earthly joys and materialism. May hint at having a great time in nature, in a restaurant and in the bedroom. If we talk about personal qualities, the page of pentacles speaks of a closed young man, an introvert who is very careful in choosing friends and others. May show a student focused on learning.";
"pageOfSwords_map_description" = "The card is characterized by an unambiguous indication of renewal, a remarkable mind and provocation. She can warn that trials and unpredictable deceit of fate are coming. If we characterize a person by the page of swords, we can say that this is an extraordinary person with significant potential, but at the same time with a difficult character, which can distinguish him from other people. But this card also suggests that a person is already in a difficult situation, trying to complicate and aggravate everything. In more serious circumstances, he turns on his childishness, instead of serious actions. The card characterizes the analytical mind, ingenuity, energy and emotionality. If we talk about situations and circumstances on this card, then it speaks of unforeseen complications, of a situation that is escalating, of the need to look for a way out of the situation and, with bated breath, show vigilance and readiness for any development of events. The Page of Swords also indicates the receipt of unexpected news, which carries information for reflection. If there are unfavorable cards nearby, most likely, the news will be quite unpleasant, not particularly significant and serious, but psychologically overwhelming - like the news of someone's lies, gossip, petty setup. Also, the card can show a false friend, a traitor, a two-faced and unreliable person. Also, the appearance of a page of swords may mean that someone is carefully watching you or indicate the likelihood of a conflict. It is the herald of a critical, hostile impulse. He may hint that the situation is difficult to clarify due to the abundance of negative information that is not directly related to the case. A positive interpretation of the Page of Swords is activity and mobilization, sharp intellect and a million ideas. This is not a card of helplessness or sitting back. The card indicates the absence of fears and doubts about getting down to business, thinking about how to achieve your goal. The person who this card characterizes enters into an argument, arming himself, looking for help and taking categorical steps and actions. He loves news and activity very much, he is always the first to know about everything. If the situation requires rushing, he will do it without a doubt. If you need the ability to be alert and aware of the danger - also good. This card involves working with your head, prioritizing, analyzing the situation, finding solutions. She says that at the moment there is every reason to judge the work done or the action that has taken place. The results have already appeared, they need to be seen and evaluated. The card also characterizes situations in which something is done in too much of a hurry.";
"pageOfWands_map_description" = "The Page of Wands, characterizing a person, most likely can talk about a young, fair-haired or light-eyed young man / girl, possibly a fiery element. The card can also talk about receiving an interesting and profitable offer, as well as a certain mood, state of mind: uplift, enthusiasm, energy, the presence of curiosity, constructive, leading to knowledge and personal growth. It can also indicate the prospect of risk, but constructive and leading to a positive result, a pleasure. The most traditional meaning of the card is a journey, a message, a good friend, a foreigner, long-awaited news. This card speaks of the emergence of a new movement in a situation that could come to a standstill, of the awakening of new interest and enthusiasm, of a new look at things. The Page of Wands brings creative enthusiasm and a desire to go in a new direction, openness to the world and opportunities, charisma and self-confidence, as well as self-confidence. The card describes a period of new exciting opportunities and ideas that are eager to develop and implement. The Page of Wands is the prospect of a fiery mood, an opening chance, in the form of an exciting idea or proposal that can be enthusiastically received. She speaks of the opportunity to go beyond the usual sphere of interest, to plunge into an exciting adventure that requires courage and a desire for risk, brightness and exciting emotions. In general, it describes a period of inspiration, creativity, change, the spontaneous beginning of something new, quivering expectation. If you interpret this card as advice, then you can attribute to it information that you should wait for an incentive from the outside, some important, probably sharp and hot information or an exciting offer, which can subsequently affect what was planned and desired and awaken a new desire to work and invest your own efforts. Also, this card may indicate that the energies of a person are not yet ready for active action for the sake of realizing the plan and are still in somewhat immature forms. On the basis of which you should wait for some time, after which it will be possible to again make an attempt to break through to the goal, gaining a somewhat more holistic experience and working on moments of infantility. It would be premature and unnecessary to plunge headlong into new events - there is not enough maturity and experience. In general, the card speaks of a promising period and energies, of a fire that flares up. A clearer context can already be interpreted based on the cards that are nearby.";
"pageOfCups_map_description" = "The Page of Cups is endowed with quiet joy, romance, dreams and dreams. The card carries an emotional load and is a symbol of love. She can warn about receiving a love message, news of a wedding, information about pregnancy or the birth of a child. The Page of Cups speaks of chances in love and relationships, speaks of pleasant experiences - fresh feelings, renewal of emotions, new acquaintances. It can be something new in existing relationships - a gift, a declaration of love, a marriage proposal. Also, the card may indicate that the good news is on the way, a tempting invitation, a sincere compliment, or someone will demonstrate their location, show open friendliness and participation. Describing a person, the card speaks of a young boy or girl who has a rich soul, sensuality and the ability for strong emotions. The auxiliary meaning of this card is help, service. A page with a goblet can show that a young man or woman will help, someone younger than the person to whom this card came out. The Page of Cups is a person who shows a sincere disposition or tries to charm. In any case, his appearance is a good and positive sign. If the person to whom the card fell is concerned about how his initiatives, business or romantic, will be accepted, then the appearance of this card is a confirmation of good assumptions. The Page of Cups is the bearer of a loving or at least just a good-natured impulse, a friendly gesture. Sometimes the Card can also indicate longing for someone and a strong desire to be together. It can also mark a promising beginning of the novel, someone's declaration of love signals the possibility of taking the first step, the fundamental existence of the possibility of agreeing and reaching mutual understanding. If nothing contradicts, then the appearance of the Page of Cups promises a filled, joyful, carefree life, emotional fullness, openness of the heart to love impulses. Also, with the appropriate cards, surrounded by a page of cups, the card can talk about the fulfillment of a cherished desire, the receipt of something long-awaited and desired. The appearance of this card may hint at pregnancy and the appearance of a newborn. It can also reflect a certain creative idea, idea, dream. It can also indicate dependent people from the person to whom this card fell out.";
"knightOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Knight of Pentacles is a card that is quite energetic and assertive in terms of knowledge, skills and focus on specific goals. She speaks of a fair amount of slowness, inertia and long concentration, but all these goals are mostly realistic and pragmatic. This is the period of life when a person is in the midst of his plans and plans, paying attention to the little things and focusing his full attention. The card indicates a sequence of actions, patience, and as a natural result - bringing to good results. If we talk about personality characteristics using this card, the card describes a middle-aged man engaged in industrial activities, or a young man, but who has long decided on his goals in life. In general, the card describes a disciplined and pedantic personality, which can be very uncompromising. Indicates such qualities as responsibility, conscientiousness, diligence, willpower. He says that the road to success is paved thanks to hard work and self-confidence. If we consider the card for the future period of time, it can become an indication that there is a need to do useful things, develop one's talents, learn to be practical, patient, perseverant, methodical - and this will lead to the desired results, which will practically not remain impossible for such a person. The card seems to remind you that a lot can be achieved, but on condition that absolute calm and concentration on the goal and work. If we talk about the period of the present time, then the map indicates the set clear and understandable tasks and the real deadlines for their implementation. The card, in general, speaks of hard work and the application of a sufficient amount of strength, of good opportunities to stabilize the financial situation, increase one's own well-being, benefiting people and faithfully doing their job. If we consider this card for the situation, then we can say that it develops sluggishly and may even come to a standstill, but in the end it will be resolved positively. The Knight of Pentacles also invites you to feel gratitude for what you already have. The card simply screams about total employment with its work: opportunities, meetings, responsibilities follow each other, and it is important, not allowing you to suppress and weaken yourself, to devote some time to understanding and consolidating the results of this entire flow. The card also symbolizes the receipt of benefits, valuable services, profits, profits, gains, benefits, signing an agreement, drawing up a business plan. The Knight of Pentacles often indicates that you need to continue to improve, gain new knowledge, follow the intended path, and the tasks set must be completed, even if the work seems hard and uninteresting. He calls to overcome all kinds of laziness and complete all unfinished projects. The card implies the ability to pull yourself together and get the job done no matter what. This card can also speak of a rush to household and garden chores, cleaning, family gatherings for food, and repairs in the house. The Knight of Pentacles is reliability, commitment to fulfilling promises and a firm movement towards the goal.";
"knightOfSwords_map_description" = "The Knight of Swords speaks of a person's oratorical abilities, his intellectual abilities, independent and cunning character. If you characterize a person according to this card, then he can be called a technocrat and a cynic who is capable of deceit and frivolity. This card is associated with great potential, which manifests rebellion, disagreement, opposition to something in the world. A person does not try to prove himself, to make an image for himself. The card has a fair measure of self-absorption, despite the fact that the knight of swords is trying to use his energy for peaceful purposes. His excellent mental abilities, love for analyzing situations and defending his points of view creates an annoying and quick-tempered wave of energy directed at everything and everyone who surrounds such a person. This card can also indicate a desperate state of affairs, rapidly developing stressful situations, vicissitudes of fate, getting into the center of some ups and downs. It can also indicate a significant fuse of a person with ideas and goals, that he is embraced by his reality. It is not a fact that reality coincides with his personal reality, which he imagines. The Knight of Swords denotes a furious self-righteousness, imperceptibly turning into righteous anger and a swift offensive, but far from always reflecting the truth. The atmosphere of the map is quite cold, sharp, carrying discord and disputes, capable of poisoning even those areas of life that have so far served as a safe and comfortable refuge. The card most often carries with it negative destructive energy, sharp discussions, slander and caustic irony. It can portend quarrels, breakups, and sometimes human meanness. Often shows a person capable of harming, humiliating and insulting, an open and dangerous enemy and a bully. A softer version of this card is a decision made not in favor of the person to whom it fell. However, in the upright position, this card always indicates a high intellectual potential that can be used for peaceful purposes, it can speak of phenomenal resourcefulness, quick wit and accomplishment of thousands of things in a short period of time. The card is good when you need strength to resist someone or something, faith in your rightness and a fearless desire to win. This is a card of a duel, battle, battle. The Knight of Swords can also portend a trip, usually urgent and stressful, or talk about events that happen quickly and unexpectedly.";
"knightOfWands_map_description" = "The Knight of Wands, characterizing a person, can talk about a middle-aged man, or about a young man who has made up his mind in life. The most frequent activities for him are entrepreneurship, middle management, antiques trading and the like. It may contain a creative streak, generosity, honesty, love of freedom. If we talk about the situation, this card speaks of an interesting proposal, a new project that makes it possible to reveal one's talents and abilities and show them from the best side, as well as test one's own strengths, a measure of courage and resourcefulness. The Knight of Wands can talk about separation, departure, departure, flight, desertion, resettlement, emigration. In layouts, the card can indicate an absent person, a person who can change the situation, and the fact that some events have begun. The card can also portend a trip, a business trip, a journey or an adventure, or just an adventure for the purpose of having fun. The Knight of Wands is quite an active card. The appearance of the Knight of Wands can portend troubles, high activity, stress, haste, fuss, an exciting stream of events, when time just comes on its heels and you have to do everything at once, because circumstances require it. It describes a period of turmoil and tension, an outburst of enthusiasm, an infusion of fresh energy, vigor, initiative, and readiness to act. The element of this card is fire, storm and onslaught, impulsiveness and spontaneity. The appearance of this card marks the readiness to throw and an indomitable desire to move forward. How this will manifest itself and what the result will be can be understood from the surrounding cards. The Knight of Wands can be a significator of a person making changes in life, and very quickly. Here, great inspiration, ardor, enthusiasm, easiness and readiness to move mountains play a big role, but such energy may not last long. This feature of this card must be remembered. In a broad sense, this card carries the message of a change in the current position and position, it gives the effect of restructuring life. This map never takes into account the time factor.";
"knightOfCups_map_description" = "The Knight of Cups, if you describe a person, characterizes romance, cordiality, purposefulness. He is true to his principles and ideals, always follows his dream, very sensitive and tactful. If we talk about age, then the person is already an adult, but not mature and not wiser with worldly experience. His positive qualities lie in his talent, the ability to indulge in his beloved work with all the enthusiasm, in the presence of his own system of values and his own idea of ​​moral standards. The appearance of this card can mean news, an offer, a love letter, an invitation, a romantic date, courtship. The Knight of Cups can talk about approaching the love and mystical side of life, about emotional upsurge. If we consider this card situationally, then we can say that a person’s actions are due to feelings coming from the depths of the soul. The card means the arrival, the approach of something or someone pleasant. This card marks the birth of romantic feelings and mutual love, the acquisition of a true ally, rapprochement or reconciliation with someone, an alliance, the successful resolution of unresolved issues in relations with others. This card creates an atmosphere of goodwill, cordiality and warmth, signifying reconciliation and harmony, elegant settlement of differences, finding a valuable compromise. If there are negative card positions next to this card, then it can be interpreted as a seducer and a deceiver, a dissolute reveler. The card also portends a time without any difficulties, good mood and cordial communication, as well as romantic interest. This card can also speak of relaxation and entertainment, the satisfaction of emotional needs, the joys of the soul. The Knight of Cups is a lover of everything delightful and beautiful, this is inspiration, the flight of the soul and thoughts, this is a detachment from worldly fuss and thoughtfulness, daydreaming, creating in your head something huge, airy and beautiful from something quite ordinary and simple.";
"kingOfPentacles_map_description" = "If we consider the King of Pentacles as a characteristic of a human personality, then such a person can be described as an intelligent and friendly, respectable man who has taken place in life, who has achieved quite a lot, with rich life experience. A person with this card has sufficient wisdom, courage, cordiality, integrity and a wide open soul. It is probably difficult for such a person to achieve goals due to gullibility and he needs to be more practical and persistent. This card symbolizes the business world as a whole, and indicates an upsurge in business, success in any enterprise, a stable career and good prospects, especially in the development of long-term projects and ideas. This card hints at qualities such as enterprise and insight, success, experience and competence, and the ability to manage. She can also talk about the desire to receive money and acquire valuable property, for achievements and authority, for the advantage of owning some kind of resources. Also, this card can indicate banal love and the fullness of a person with positive emotions, his satisfaction and good attitude. The card inspires a real assessment of situations, the active implementation of the plan and the protection of what has been achieved. The card can also be a harbinger of productive work, interesting exclusive purchases. The King of Pentacles represents experience and leadership, meaningful life experience, enterprise and success. The card, like the person on whom it fell, can provide support and encouragement, give wise advice that stands firmly on its own feet and can tell you how to unravel the tangled. The traditional meaning of this card is a wealthy gentleman, a person capable of practical help and grand gestures, solid, wealthy, who is the personification of stability and reliability. The King of Pentacles can indicate a father, spouse, wealthy partner, practical mentor, financial advisor, sponsor. In general, the card speaks of a stable situation and a solid foundation for any undertakings.";
"kingOfSwords_map_description" = "The King of Swords, characterizing the personality of a person, speaks of a high level of intelligence, objectivity, versatility, a flexible rational approach to life. He speaks of a person with a lot of interests, insight and intelligence. The card describes an authoritative person to whom many people turn for advice, about the ability to give wise advice, recommendation, hint, about having a remarkable mind of an adviser and great life experience. The card also speaks of a correctly chosen strategy, dedication, the ability to overcome many obstacles, and leadership qualities. The King of Swords is a leader who has managed to gain authority for himself. Also, when characterizing a person, he can indicate a former partner, his coldness, sharpness and a serious attitude. If we consider the card as a description of the process, then it speaks of inspiration with some new serious ideas and striving for new goals. The card can indicate a need for knowledge or understanding of any area or issue, a lot of ideas and the ability to act assertively to implement them. The card hints at a clear strategy, composure, a critical approach and precise implementation. The King of Swords is also a card for resolving the most pressing problems and difficult issues, a ruthless ability to make difficult decisions. The card may indicate a collision with the need to make such a decision, based on logic, facts and principles. It carries the need for efficiency and accuracy. It can also talk about the restoration of peace and justice, established from a position of strength, which balances the conflicting and opposing. The King of Swords symbolizes the power of various forms: the power of the father, the boss, the judge. He bears the burden of responsibility, is aware of it, is a professional in his field, has clarity and speed of thinking. The people described by this card are correct, keep their distance, do their duty responsibly, are able to cope with difficulties, and are detached from their own needs and feelings. The main qualities of this card: masculinity, integrity and fearlessness. A person passing under the king of swords can be quite dangerous, aggressive, prudent and purposeful. Also, the qualities of this card are loyalty to one's concepts and beliefs. Such people are more respected and feared than loved. If we interpret the question of interest on this card, then we can say that this question is absolutely fundamental, backed up by an idea, an internal goal, a willingness to go to great lengths, it can indicate the adoption of a final decision and the determination of further being in a strategic thought-out form. Also, the situation under consideration can be dangerous, doubtful, fraught with grief and disappointment. The King of Swords can be a reminder of a pre-existing mental or physical wound that is still making itself felt.";
"kingOfWands_map_description" = "The King of Wands speaks of such qualities as leadership, the ability to lead the masses, the gift of persuasion, patronage, enviable perseverance in achieving one's goals. The card has strength, wisdom, courage, the ability to respect other people's opinions and help people. The card can serve as a sign of success in various areas of life. It can mark meeting interesting people, changes and innovations in life, surprises. The King of Wands can talk about personal efforts leading to success, promising business projects, career growth and the opportunity to achieve a lot. If we consider the King of Wands as a description of the situation, then it is generally favorable. The traditional meaning of this card is the flowering of social fulfillment, power, and the achievement of results. The card can also indicate a high position in society, earned respect, valuable connections, great opportunities, fame and glory. The King of Wands has a conscious commitment to goals, a desire to bring his ideals to life, to inspire others and preferably in large numbers. High motivation, willingness to go to great lengths to achieve your goals, heroic deeds, the conquest and defense of territories, a passionate attitude to business - these are the areas that this card affects. The King of Wands is a leader with strong business acumen, passionate soul, energy, high libido and a love of being the center of attention. The card can talk about a proud and independent position in life, about the desire to act and run forward without stopping, about the fulfillment of one's own desires, the implementation of plans. If we consider the situation and its resolution on this card, then the card says that in order to achieve success, you need to work, but the circumstances of the situation are favorable, there is honesty in it, it is also possible to receive unexpected help, or no opposition is foreseen in the implementation. The King of Wands also indicates honesty, decency, ambition, bright charisma, conscientiousness and directness. According to this card, one can say about the absence of fear, about accepting challenges, and the ability to convince. It can also talk about the appearance of a person older in age, position, or simply life experience as a symbol of a patron who is benevolent and ready to help as much as possible. His advice and alliance with him can be extremely helpful. The King of Wands is a movement towards new horizons, bright and ambitious.";
"kingOfCups_map_description" = "The King of Cups often serves as a sign of affection for one's native places and one's own cozy home. He can talk about the onset of a wide bright streak and a favorable resolution of all difficulties, about relationships that will become stronger, about establishing a strong emotional connection and trust between spouses. If we interpret this card as a characteristic of a person, the card speaks of a successful, responsible man, mature, fair, reasonable, honest, educated and well-mannered, who knows how to impress women. One of the classic meanings of the card is to receive wise advice, comfort and support. She speaks of a friend, a benefactor who is ready to listen and help. The card can also often indicate a loving and supportive father, or a person who is paternally related. Also, the card can speak of sincere affection and trust, understanding and location. The main quality of the King of Cups is empathy, disinterested help, courtesy. The King of Cups may indicate a good friend, a loving husband, a caring father, a generous philanthropist. If we are not talking about a person, then she speaks of reason and honor, friendliness, goodwill, and the absence of a threat. It marks very favorable circumstances for everything planned, the outcome will be favorable. This card is a sign that a person will not be left alone: at the right time they will always come to the rescue and make it possible to realize plans. The King of Cups indicates confidence in the chosen path and a calm attitude to ongoing events, advising you to rely on your feelings, trust your imagination, a contemplative mood, a meditative approach and positive vibrations of love. In general, for any case under consideration, the card is good and favorable, it speaks of fairly positive energies, emotional fullness, the breadth of the soul and gestures. She comfortably envelops with paternal care, like a duvet and exudes calm and harmony.";
"queenOfPentacles_map_description" = "The Queen of Pentacles speaks of maturity, experience, sanity, endurance, serenity, fertility. The card has a positive and dignified side, speaks of stability and calmness, patience, sensuality and foresight. Considering this card as a characteristic of the human personality, it describes a woman who is stable, maintaining the security of material values, for whom it is important to have not only a stable income, but also strong family ties, a house with insurance to boot. Such women are often practical, reliable, have a bias in materialism, excellent mothers and caring spouses, they can be earthly elements. The card speaks of the hassle and care associated with pleasant shopping, housekeeping, manual labor, creating a cozy atmosphere, and putting things in order. The Queen of Pentacles often signifies auspicious events that match desires, a secure job, a steady income, and strength. Usually this card indicates a situation of stability, orderliness and comfort, confidence, well-being and prosperity. This situation rests on common sense and the correct vision of things. The Queen of Pentacles brings the desire for material wealth and pleasure, as well as a general improvement in life's circumstances. The card can symbolize self-realization in the material world, it is good for starting promising projects and the readiness to realize realistically feasible tasks. She can talk about a process that has already begun and is now in a state of elaboration, putting worries and labors into it. The process can be quite long and unhurried, focused and concentrated, and has the energy of prosperity and solidity for the future. The Queen of Pentacles has a desire to help others, generously endow the world and relatives with resources and benefits from the heart and without fuss. The card may indicate a mother, spouse, a woman who keeps the house and order in it. If we consider this card in a broader sense, then it can talk about the homeland, the area in which there is a feeling of warm home and comfortable environment. myself. The Queen of Pentacles can also carry a sense of indifference and condescension in a certain context of matching cards in her environment.";
"queenOfSwords_map_description" = "The Queen of Swords is indicative of an independent individual who has many thoughts and ideas. If we characterize a person, then we are talking about a smart and progressive woman with an analytical mind, unable to listen to her own intuition and inner voice. In her character there is no kindness, mercy, as she follows a rational approach in life, achieves her goals. This card can predict a bitter experience, personal loss, sadness, loss, deprivation, grief. The card can also talk about readiness and propensity for conflicts, excessive demands, inevitable criticisms, about acute situations that will inevitably pull you out of a calm life and force you to connect the rational side of a person. If you describe the situation in terms of the queen of swords, then it is quite emotionally destructive and can turn into misfortune. Also, this card may indicate rather difficult negotiations in which you will have to overcome a tough confrontation. Achieving results will not be easy. Things will move, but within the framework of indisputable prohibitions and in strict accordance with the accepted rules, depending on the context of what is being achieved. If we talk about the more positive side of the Queen of Swords, then she indicates the importance of logical arguments, independent actions and reasonable decisions. It can describe the process of clarifying, clarifying a situation, complete control over oneself, emotions, reactions and actions, which guarantees the further success of the planned business. If the surrounding cards are unfavorable enough, then the queen of swords indicates someone's malicious will, malevolence, a person capable of causing great damage. The Queen of Swords can also allude to the need to face objections and to the influential role of some person who behaves emotionally distant and unfriendly, but is ready to be a completely objective expert. Another meaning of this card is emptiness, love of freedom, incompleteness, unemployment, lack of something, neediness and detachment. Often, the card can also indicate a woman from the past, a former partner, for example, who has a rather sharp relationship with the person to whom this card came out.";
"queenOfWands_map_description" = "The Queen of Wands describes an experienced, mature and practical woman who has taken place in life, a magnetic personality, strong-willed and imposing. She is self-confident, active, proactive, independent, open and charismatic. Such a woman makes decisions quickly and confidently, knows what she wants and where she is going, loves to shine and be in the spotlight, is highly professional, able to overcome obstacles, challenging fate. She has a very well developed intuition and possession of the power of positive thinking, thanks to her pride and ambition, her claims to leadership are very relevant. She is also self-reliant and independent, successful and ambitious. The Queen of Wands is very self-sufficient, attractive, open and friendly, people can count on support from such a person in their endeavors. Allies and inspirers can appear on this card. But another meaning of the card suggests that a fairly bright rival may appear, which will be difficult to prove its advantages. Considering the Queen of Wands as a description of the process, we can say that claims to leadership are relevant in this matter, and the struggle will be for pride and ambition. The card is responsible for ambition, the desire for independence and independence, success in a career, in social life, self-realization and personal growth. The Queen of Wands can also speak of inspiration and passion for something, as well as a passionate fulfillment of what was conceived. If we talk about the events on this map, then these events have already begun and are in full swing, developing rapidly. Here we are already talking about an acquired form, about a process that is gaining strength. If we are talking about an ambitious project, responsible performance, inspiring business - success is very likely. The card is conducive to career growth, business success, popularity and fame. Additional cards located next to the Queen of Wands will be able to suggest the context of the situation of interest, which is in the culmination phase and which has already become part of the current reality. Perhaps it has already borne fruit or guarantees their obligatory presence.";
"queenOfCups_map_description" = "The Queen of Cups, when characterized by a person, describes a woman - sensual, kind-hearted, intuitive, artistic, creative, soft and gentle. She personifies kindness, willingness to help and give wise advice in matters of the heart, with which there is a feeling of comfort and security. A person according to this card often hovers in the clouds and is less distinct and structured in its manifestation, filled with spirituality, quite spiritual and absorbed in emotions. Often this card speaks of a loving woman or beloved by the person to whom she fell. The Queen of Cups can also describe a man who is quite tender, sincere, affectionate, vulnerable, overly emotional, living not with his mind, but with feelings and intuition. He can personify the life position of a person to whom you can cry, confess. This is a person who is ready to help - sensual and empathic. He can provide an invaluable service. Also, the Queen of Cups symbolizes success in conceived affairs with the help of brilliant intuition and a feeling of constant foreboding, like a gift of clairvoyance. The card may indicate the habit of relying on the imagination, and not the arguments of the mind, it may seem that a person is not of this world, is constantly in his thoughts and dreams. The card may indicate that the emotions associated with a particular issue have already arisen, come into action, and in the situation under consideration there is a fairly vivid emotional reaction. The Queen of Cups speaks of a rather favorable forecast for the future, but you should not count on too significant results. Everything that will be achieved will bring a lot of joy and pleasure, but for more serious results, you will have to work hard to a significant extent. The card can also indicate the potential for making dreams and desires come true. Also, when diagnosing a situation, the card says that it is safe enough, you can treat it with confidence, there are no hidden traps and secret enemies in it. This card emphasizes a peaceful and harmonious environment, comfort and security. It can also express the need for understanding and love, falling under the influence of feelings, susceptibility to extraneous influence.";

